+    /// Returns true when the caller is verified Ozey internal staff.
+    ///
+    /// `ozeyStaff` is a Firebase Auth custom claim. Custom claims can only be
+    /// set through the Admin SDK (never by a client), and are read from the
+    /// signed ID token — so this check costs no Firestore read and cannot be
+    /// spoofed. Grants READ-ONLY access for the Ozey Console. It is never
+    /// consulted by any write rule.
+    function isOzeyStaff() {
+      return isSignedIn() && request.auth.token.ozeyStaff == true;
+    }
+
     /// Returns true when the authenticated user owns the member document
